docs/issues/391/runtime-refactor/architecture/01-agent-core-runtime-free.md:238:The external-hook request/callback/redaction contract is **not a Phase 1 deliverable**. External hooks depend on durable approvals (the single on-stream approval channel, T1) and on multi-agent target resolution, so the request shape, auth/redaction/callback contract, and target resolution all land in **Phase 7** (`../work/P7-multi-agent-inspection/TODO.md`, BBP7-006), routed onto the T1 approval channel — never a second channel. P1 adds **no** external-hook request/callback/redaction contract and **no** hook route.
