docs/plans/google-signup-child-app-plan.html:357:          <div class="mini"><h4>1. Config + shared types</h4><p>Add <code>auth.google</code>, <code>features.googleOauth</code>, capability fields, <code>TomlAppConfig.features.google_oauth</code>, and update <code>buildRuntimeConfigPayload()</code>.</p><p><strong>Verify:</strong> config tests cover enabled + disabled cases.</p></div>
