563-| `subagent.called` | Child dispatched; carries `childSessionId`. [Sessions](https://github.com/vercel/eve/blob/main/docs/concepts/sessions-runs-and-streaming.md) |
564-| `subagent.completed` | Delegated child successfully finished. [Sessions](https://github.com/vercel/eve/blob/main/docs/concepts/sessions-runs-and-streaming.md) |
565-| `reasoning.appended` | Incremental reasoning delta plus cumulative block. [Sessions](https://github.com/vercel/eve/blob/main/docs/concepts/sessions-runs-and-streaming.md) |
566-| `reasoning.completed` | Final reasoning block. [Sessions](https://github.com/vercel/eve/blob/main/docs/concepts/sessions-runs-and-streaming.md) |
567-| `message.appended` | Incremental assistant delta plus cumulative block. [Sessions](https://github.com/vercel/eve/blob/main/docs/concepts/sessions-runs-and-streaming.md) |
568-| `message.completed` | Final assistant block; may occur multiple times per turn. [Sessions](https://github.com/vercel/eve/blob/main/docs/concepts/sessions-runs-and-streaming.md) |
569-| `result.completed` | Structured-schema result in `data.result`. [Sessions](https://github.com/vercel/eve/blob/main/docs/concepts/sessions-runs-and-streaming.md) |
